CALL newPutForth(231, 1, 'That\'s hyperbole, but not by much. Fifty years of Democratic one-party rule in cities has produced Detroit, Baltimore, and Chicago. They call that progress. I call it managed decline.');
CALL newPutForth(232, 1, 'Trump built a global real estate empire from a modest starting point through deal-making, hustle, and willingness to take risk. For every business that failed, five succeeded. That\'s entrepreneurship.');
CALL newPutForth(233, 1, 'Show me a stupid billionaire — one who built it, not just inherited and kept it. They don\'t exist. You don\'t accumulate that kind of capital without intelligence, resilience, and risk tolerance.');
CALL newPutForth(385, 1, 'Playing nice with people who won\'t return the favor means losing every time. Ruthlessness — not cruelty, but willingness to do what it takes — is how power is won and held in politics.');
CALL newPutForth(574, 1, 'Democrats spent the last fifty years dismantling everything that made working-class communities work — stable families, local industry, religious institutions, neighborhood schools. They serve elites, not people like me.');
CALL newPutForth(575, 1, 'Democrats claim to fight for the working class while their policies kill American manufacturing, drive up energy costs, and flood the labor market with cheap workers. Their record betrays their rhetoric.');
CALL newPutForth(576, 1, 'China is building a blue-water navy. Iran is building a nuclear weapon. Russia is rebuilding the Soviet empire. Democrats are spending political capital on the military\'s pronoun handbook. Not serious leadership.');
CALL newPutForth(985, 1, 'Descendants of people who were never colonized don\'t owe reparations for what happened 200 years ago. Present people should be judged by their present actions, not by the sins of ancestors they never knew.');
CALL newPutForth(990, 1, 'Northern Democrats passed the Civil Rights Act; Southern Democrats left over it — that\'s documented history. The South went Republican. That\'s the political fact, separate from whatever motivated each individual voter.');
CALL newPutForth(991, 1, 'The Solid South broke apart because of the Civil Rights Act. Lyndon Johnson reportedly said he\'d lose the South for a generation. He was right. That\'s historical fact, not a Southern Strategy attack.');
CALL newPutForth(992, 1, 'Medicare, Medicaid, food stamps, HUD, Great Society programs — all LBJ\'s legacy. The modern Democratic Party has been defending and expanding that welfare state ever since. He built it.');
